    outcome: "The post-fix month moved the metrics that matter: +15% checkout completion, secondary CTA clicks up +29%, and support chats about confused promises down by a fifth. The audit has become Dr. Stengler's quiet advantage — every campaign now ships against a tested gold path. Just as importantly, the way the numbers moved confirmed the diagnosis: the metrics that recovered were exactly the ones the blocked or contradicted screens were supposed to carry. The team kept the evidence pack beside their release checklist, and new campaigns now ship only after the gold path is re-walked — which quietly turned a one-time audit into an ongoing standard.",
