    outcome: "The post-fix month moved the metrics that matter: +23% product-page-to-cart clicks, secondary CTA clicks up +26%, and support chats about confused promises down by a fifth. The audit has become Expressive Audio's quiet advantage — every campaign now ships against a tested gold path. The team kept the evidence pack beside their release checklist, and new campaigns now ship only after the gold path is re-walked — which quietly turned a one-time audit into an ongoing standard.",
